Hi,

the below is the changelogs for other trees.

major changes are more documentations of alsa-lib and the addition of 
us428control utility.


Takashi

================================================================
*** ALSA-LIBS ***

2003-10-21 19:41  perex

	* alsa-lib/configure.in: 0.9.8

2003-10-21 19:39  perex

	* alsa-lib/: include/sound/asound.h, src/Versions,
	  src/control/control.c, src/control/control_hw.c,
	  src/control/control_local.h: - added support for user control
	  elements

2003-10-20 16:04  tiwai

	* alsa-lib/src/seq/seq.c: more documents as introduction.

2003-10-20 16:04  tiwai

	* alsa-lib/src/pcm/pcm.c: use only #xxx to link (for the recent
	  doxygen).

2003-10-17 15:53  perex

	* alsa-lib/src/pcm/pcm_direct.c: Use _exit() in server_job()

2003-10-17 09:38  perex

	* alsa-lib/src/pcm/pcm_direct.c: Fixed problem with Xwindows
	  (socket descriptors)

2003-10-13 18:34  tiwai

	* alsa-lib/src/conf/cards/: Audigy.conf, Audigy2.conf: changed the
	  PCM routing for the recent redesign of the driver.

2003-10-13 14:06  perex

	* alsa-lib/: include/control.h, include/mixer_ordinary.h,
	  src/Versions, src/alisp/alisp.c, src/alisp/alisp_snd.c,
	  src/conf/sndo-mixer.alisp, src/control/hcontrol.c,
	  src/ordinary_mixer/ordinary_mixer.c, test/omixer.c: More changes
	  to the ordinary mixer API

2003-10-13 12:42  perex

	* alsa-lib/test/pcm.c: Fixed typo

2003-09-30 19:02  tiwai

	* alsa-lib/test/: .cvsignore, Makefile.am, iecbits.c, iecset.c:
	  added iecset program (this could be to alsa-utils after more
	  enhancements).

2003-09-26 08:38  perex

	* alsa-lib/src/conf/cards/Makefile.am: Fixed typo

================================================================
*** ALSA-UTILS, ALSA-TOOLS, ALSA-OSS ***

2003-10-21 19:41  perex

	* alsa-utils/configure.in, alsa-oss/configure.in,
	  alsa-tools/Makefile: 0.9.8

2003-10-17 09:34  perex

	* alsa-utils/amixer/amixer.c: Fixed possible buffer overrun

2003-10-15 19:06  tiwai

	* alsa-oss/alsa-oss.c: - suppress the error message from alsa-lib
	  (for error opens).  - use default devices as fallback.

2003-10-15 19:05  tiwai

	* alsa-oss/aoss.in: use libdir for 64bit architectures.

2003-10-12 10:45  perex

	* alsa-tools/sscape_ctl/sscape_ctl.c: Fixed warning

2003-10-10 09:47  perex

	* alsa-tools/envy24control/envy24control.c: Bo Johansson
	  <bjont97@student.vxu.se> - fixes crash when an invalid option was
	  given

2003-10-06 17:57  tiwai

	* alsa-tools/: Makefile, us428control/.cvsignore,
	  us428control/Cus428State.cc, us428control/Cus428State.h,
	  us428control/Cus428_ctls.cc, us428control/Cus428_ctls.h,
	  us428control/Makefile.am, us428control/configure.in,
	  us428control/cvscompile, us428control/us428control.cc,
	  us428control/usbus428ctldefs.h: added us428control utility  by
